UGAHacks11 Project Breakdown
Members:
- Igor Goncalves: Machine Learning
- Jordan Delp: Backend Engineer
- Ryan Meyer: Frontend Engineer
Project Name: Impendios
Goal: To create a Bank Statement analyzer application that intakes the
statement pdf, categorizes/finds patterns to then display in a neat and digestible
manner.
Tech Stack:
Frontend: React Vite
Backend: FastAPI
Model: Naive Bayes
Libraries: pdfplumber, sklearn, numpy, pandas, pickle, …
MVP Features:
- Home Page
- Budget Page
- total income earned
- total income spent
- left over amount
- spending by category
- category most spent
- category least spent
Bonus Features:
- About Page
- more info about project
- about each member
- Custom Loading Page
- Contact Page
- Auth
